 "segments": [
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "In this opening scene of episode nine, Ivan Samsonov and his wife Nina are in bed late at night arguing about his behavior at the political concert. Furious at rumors of infidelity, Samsonov insists he did nothing wrong and angrily threatens her with divorce, while Nina laughs off his dramatic threats. Let's listen to the scene in Russian first; don't worry about catching every word.",
   "gap": 0.8
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Сколько раз тебе говорить?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Я просто сходил на концерт.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Я был там с одноклассником.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Я тебе не изменял!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "nina",
   "t": "А люди говорят другое.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Мне всё равно, что ты думаешь!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Ты меня поняла?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Я разведусь с тобой!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Тебе всё понятно?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "nina",
   "t": "Самсон, ну всё, хватит.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "nina",
   "t": "Не смеши меня, пожалуйста.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "nina",
   "t": "Пойдём уже спать.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Посмотрим, Нина. Посмотрим.",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Now let's examine Ivan and Nina's midnight bedroom argument line by line. Ivan sits up in bed frowning in the dark.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Сколько раз тебе говорить?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'How many times do I have to tell you?' Samsonov expresses exasperation.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Я просто сходил на концерт.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I just went to a concert.' Samsonov insists his night out was completely innocent, just a quick trip to the concert.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Я был там с одноклассником.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I was there with a classmate.' He claims he was only hanging out there with an old friend from school.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Я тебе не изменял!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I didn't cheat on you!' Backed into a corner, he swears up and down that he stayed faithful to her.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nina",
   "t": "А люди говорят другое.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'And people say otherwise.' Nina remains skeptical about his late-night whereabouts.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Мне всё равно, что ты думаешь!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I don't care what you think!' Literally, 'to me it is all the same' — he snaps that he couldn't care less what she believes.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Ты меня поняла?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Did you understand me?' He barks a sharp check to make sure his threat is sinking in.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Я разведусь с тобой!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I will divorce you!' Out of patience, Samsonov escalates the fight by threatening to end their marriage.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Тебе всё понятно?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Is everything clear to you?' Samsonov demands acknowledgment.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nina",
   "t": "Самсон, ну всё, хватит.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Samson, that's enough, stop it.' Nina brushes off his outburst like a tired parent calming down a cranky child.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nina",
   "t": "Не смеши меня, пожалуйста.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Don't make me laugh, please.' She tells him to stop being ridiculous because she doesn't buy his tough act for a second.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nina",
   "t": "Пойдём уже спать.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Let's just go to sleep.' Nina tries to defuse the midnight argument and turn off the light.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Посмотрим, Нина. Посмотрим.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'We will see, Nina. We will see.' Stung by her laughter, he mutters a dark warning twice under his breath. Now let's listen to the entire bedroom argument again without interruption.",
